<title>POLAND: Polish stocks end higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks end higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks rose, two fell and three were flat in 3.1-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining 11 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 1.4 percent in a 7.7-million- zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
